## Reproducing the manifest

    cd lean
    { find MPUP DiophCompression scripts -type f \( -name '*.lean' -o -name '*.py' -o -name '*.sh' \) -print0
      printf '%s\0' MPUP.lean DiophCompression.lean lakefile.lean lean-toolchain; } \
      | LC_ALL=C sort -z | xargs -0 shasum -a 256 | awk '{print $1"  "$2}'

The seal (`correspondence/SEAL_*.txt`) records the SHA-256 of this listing as `SOURCE_MANIFEST_SHA256`; a build whose listing hashes differently is building a different tree.

